# Favourites (API.md §4, §5, §5.3). Sign in first with dev-login (Development only); the cookie is kept between requests.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5107/api/v1
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@variantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Sign in (dev-login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "email": "bartek@test.local", "nickname": "bartek" }

### Favourite a recipe (idempotent; 404 when not visible)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favorite
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Unfavourite a recipe (idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recipes/{{recipeId}}/favorite
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Favourite a variant (idempotent; 404 when not visible)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/variants/{{variantId}}/favorite
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Unfavourite a variant (idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/variants/{{variantId}}/favorite
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Ulubione: recipes and variants merged, newest favourite first, only currently visible items
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites?page=1&pageSize=20
